  "content": "<p>这个模组为<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/emi\" rel=\"nofollow\">EMI</a>添加了新功能。这个新功能允许用户确定每个村民职业所需的工作台。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>为此，您可以在绿宝石或村民刷怪蛋上使用EMI的用途键（默认：U），它将显示所有村民职业的列表。如果您想知道哪个模组添加了该职业，可以按住Shift键，使其在职业前显示模组ID。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如果您在寻找<strong>REI</strong>的等效功能，请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/roughly-enough-professions-rep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Roughly Enough Professions (REP)</a></p><p>如果您在寻找<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a>的等效功能，请查看<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-professions-jep\" rel=\"nofollow\">Just Enough Professions (JEP)</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0KFppoR.png\" alt=\"Akliz Partner\" width=\"320\" height=\"152\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fakliz.net%252fmrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">需要服务器？使用促销代码“mrbysco”可享受首月20%的折扣</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>如有问题，欢迎加入我的Discord。</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/maPeNBK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/611982123435556884/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"Discord Link\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>&nbsp;<strong>想支持我们吗？</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Mrbysco\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -Mrbysco</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/shynieke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CEpJohV.png\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"152\" height=\"35\"></a>&nbsp; -ShyNieke</p>",
